   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_97866a589c732743b1e6",
   "sourceHash": "97866a589c732743b1e6d3b1c229b3beda59efcd0804dc130fadf8bafec64adf",
   "text": "“走进一个富丽堂皇的世界，让Royal Villa迷人的氛围唤醒您的感官。宽敞的布局与无可挑剔的细节，让这座别墅带来真正沉浸式的体验——在这里，阿育吠陀疗愈与高品质的舒适享受相融合。“",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'luxurious indulgence' rendered as 高品质的舒适享受 (premium comfort) per clinical register lock. 'Royal Villa' kept as proper name."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e71a8c7be93d8bbfcc35",
   "sourceHash": "e71a8c7be93d8bbfcc35e0785d1f446c9bb978879c7663e559fa040c02f7880d",
   "text": "Royal Villa以出人意料的亲民价格，呈现出优雅与正宗的非凡融合，不负其“皇家”之名。世界知名的室内设计师以中世纪印度宫殿为灵感，匠心打造了这些住所，营造出宁静而精致的优雅氛围。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_85e550e0f491c4012517",
   "sourceHash": "85e550e0f491c401251769ab934045e3cf4afd15f584f7c143dbc8851d9f31cf",
   "text": "在这里，入住者可以体验过去只有贵族才能享有的生活，配有华美的陈设和一流的设施。别墅的设计巧妙地将高品质的舒适与阿育吠陀生活原则相融合，打造出传统养生与现代舒适交汇的独特静养之所",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'Guests' rendered as 入住者 (those staying), 'opulent comfort' as 高品质的舒适 and 'contemporary indulgence' as 现代舒适 per clinical register lock. Source has no final full stop; none added."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c4c933bb0face393d07b",
   "sourceHash": "c4c933bb0face393d07b1000caae566616b06ffa1a611cd5ede1ea172dc31b20",
   "text": "每座Royal Villa均配备：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_060863ac0134cf74d789",
